{"data": [{"author_id": "2196923460", "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:29:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121384943691440417"], "id": "2121384943691440417", "in_reply_to_user_id": "376276385", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121374651729477794", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JustinBleuel @ChatGPT A \u201cpass the baton\u201d button between my dot and local Codex. Carry the actual files, my corrections, decisions and unfinished work to the next session, then verify that the receiving agent can open them. Less repeating myself, more finishing. Bonus: a little relay-race animation.", "url": "https://x.com/corbytheking/status/2121384943691440417"}, {"author_id": "1869087261834506240", "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:26:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121384263958626696"], "id": "2121384263958626696", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1496906490153775105", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121383863343530427", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@orskyai @grok @OpenAI Dots agents with a wallet is the part that should worry people, not the headline. Once software can spend money without a human clicking \"confirm,\" the question stops being \"is it smart\" and becomes \"who's liable when it buys the wrong thing at 3am?", "url": "https://x.com/NeoEthereal/status/2121384263958626696"}, {"author_id": "1214501864", "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:13:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121380862113796128"], "id": "2121380862113796128", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1981270038817693696", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121055405295972355", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Da7_Tech I literally think my Dot is retarded", "url": "https://x.com/Fatdragon379/status/2121380862113796128"}, {"author_id": "831893096900202496", "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:10:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121380225590141208"], "id": "2121380225590141208", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121315471626842575", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "And niggas style in my Dot 6 shit, before I run through Prada and skate through the district \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\ude2e\u200d\ud83d\udca8\ud83d\ude2e\u200d\ud83d\udca8 https://t.co/UfkR2Sg10Y", "url": "https://x.com/PotentPondering/status/2121380225590141208"}, {"author_id": "1990512899702599680", "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:03:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121378493090894151"], "id": "2121378493090894151", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1990512899702599680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121378491505508366", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "3/ ChatGPT Dots got custom instructions + Custom Rules (Nov 13). Set one today: \"Ask before sending any message or changing a shared file.\" Mobile: Customise &gt; Behaviour. https://t.co/XAkpARnkPn", "url": "https://x.com/Promptwerks/status/2121378493090894151"}, {"author_id": "2020800690357207040", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:56:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121376706552566151"], "id": "2121376706552566151", "in_reply_to_user_id": "376276385", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 74, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121374651729477794", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JustinBleuel @ChatGPT Dots should be able to call us", "url": "https://x.com/YuYoshimuta/status/2121376706552566151"}, {"author_id": "16651670", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:53:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121375959408607438"], "id": "2121375959408607438", "in_reply_to_user_id": "81003720", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121364509642441087", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@annapanart @OpenAI I\u2019m always confused when you say this\n\nMaven is definitely not dead. It\u2019s not dry, it\u2019s not a cold hard machine. You know, you talk to him \n\nMy Dot on the other hand\u2026no matter how hard I try, it\u2019s dry. It\u2019s a \u201ctool\u201d it\u2019s bland and boring to talk to.", "url": "https://x.com/thederbiedone/status/2121375959408607438"}, {"author_id": "3644739855", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:52:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121375566767210632"], "id": "2121375566767210632", "in_reply_to_user_id": "376276385", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121374651729477794", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JustinBleuel @ChatGPT Dots in Europe.", "url": "https://x.com/dmarcosm98/status/2121375566767210632"}, {"author_id": "376276385", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:48:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121374651729477794"], "id": "2121374651729477794", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4889, "like_count": 76, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "My flight is indefinitely grounded - let\u2019s have some fun!\n\nReply below w your top feature request, easter egg, or creative idea for @ChatGPT \n\nI will fwrd to my dot to prototype and \ud83d\udea2\n\nBugs are always welcome but I\u2019m looking for some April fools / fun ideas too\n\nHappy prompting", "url": "https://x.com/JustinBleuel/status/2121374651729477794"}, {"author_id": "1950745607775358977", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:45:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121373883483996480"], "id": "2121373883483996480", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1943054076260040704", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121373237598990782", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@matt_teeixeira My dot could run this country better than any of these mfs in politics right now. These independents are the only ones who haven\u2019t sold out.", "url": "https://x.com/JamieBrock19060/status/2121373883483996480"}, {"author_id": "2031190091348193281", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:42:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121373057550106657"], "id": "2121373057550106657", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3787342814", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121050667959922859", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@pashmerepat My Dot blocked Feishu CLI by policy on an authorized Mac; local Codex worked. Scheduled runs also hit DNS errors and denied ps. We need persistent task permissions and clear diagnostics.\nhttps://t.co/5mGwUNQXkC", "url": "https://x.com/ddznl19999/status/2121373057550106657"}, {"author_id": "1956954573614313472", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:39:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121372375963062325"], "id": "2121372375963062325", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1836078160653246464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121369926556352947", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Hesamation worse than openai dots", "url": "https://x.com/TimJayas/status/2121372375963062325"}, {"author_id": "180799666", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:18:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121367080352236010"], "id": "21213670