 "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121365418531270963", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@nicolasbackal Letting my dot buy things with my card still feels wild to me \u2014 I'll try it for something small first and see if I actually trust it, lol", "url": "https://x.com/YunaElira/status/2121365702389207304"}, {"author_id": "2110370285832540160", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:11:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121365449581703420"], "id": "2121365449581703420", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120999993079451919", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux I use my Dot constantly because I\u2019m someone who needs to think out loud and talk through ideas, processes, and problems. Having a voice assistant with the potential that dot has, that allows me to work through things with has been incredibly helpful, and I\u2019ve been really excited", "url": "https://x.com/Dobbysmom5611/status/2121365449581703420"}, {"author_id": "1383894709093896200", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:07:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121364376464605385"], "id": "2121364376464605385", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1674506538336022528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121244683883941903", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@nickbaumann_ My dot can\u2019t seem to access its own browser tabs. Why?", "url": "https://x.com/Fermented16/status/2121364376464605385"}, {"author_id": "1690235528850116608", "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:03:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121363286654632064"], "id": "2121363286654632064", "in_reply_to_user_id": "373800245", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121359998231904357", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Jborgwing @feedthejim @Angaisb_ I\u2019m pretty sure I\u2019ve seen my threads do this, when they are started by my dot, I could be mistaken", "url": "https://x.com/_ImDaniel__/status/2121363286654632064"}, {"author_id": "2028443345077641216", "created_at": "2026-11-13T21:53:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121360761046065397"], "id": "2121360761046065397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "one of my favorite things my Dot does is add events straight to my calendar so I don\u2019t forget about them. small thing but it helps a lot.", "url": "https://x.com/gheedbizri21/status/2121360761046065397"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121360486897770496"]}, "author_id": "1886734699638202368", "created_at": "2026-11-13T21:52:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121360493462073568"], "id": "2121360493462073568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The most impressive feat of technology I've ever encountered. Weeks after asking if my paper had citations I was updated that in fact I got 1 citation completely unprompted ! From a separate chat entirely. OpenAI dots now my favourite ever consumer product. https://t.co/L4Xyt0YFuc", "url": "https://x.com/DylanBForde/status/2121360493462073568"}, {"author_id": "2058570195543756800", "created_at": "2026-11-13T21:50:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121360057614868521"], "id": "2121360057614868521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anyone know what happened to ChatGPT dots in the EU? \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddfa\n\nThis morning I saw them for the first time in the app and now they're gone...", "url": "https://x.com/z4mbon/status/2121360057614868521"}, {"author_id": "1374451634365812743", "created_at": "2026-11-13T21:49:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121359800130822380"], "id": "2121359800130822380", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1734993579666460672", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121301940034482483", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MefreeNTR2098 @_samirism Odd. Zero issues like that here. I love using my dot.", "url": "https://x.com/m0nkeypantz/status/2121359800130822380"}, {"author_id": "1980979930725810176", "created_at": "2026-11-13T21:47:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121359199342838170"], "id": "2121359199342838170", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Yesterday I posted that in the EU we only get to see AI agents by reading about them on \ud835\udd4f.\nThis morning ChatGPT Dots started showing up for people in Europe.\nNext I'll complain about not owning a Ferrari.", "url": "https://x.com/marcopet_/status/2121359199342838170"}, {"author_id": "1943059388723531776", "created_at": "2026-11-13T21:44:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121358656524738816"], "id": "2121358656524738816", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ChatGPT is driving me nuts. My dot can see my Windows VM is connected but can\u2019t control it. A Work chat on the same VM works, yet the dot can\u2019t access that chat either. Reboots, reconnects, my work is still blocked. At least my Dot was able to submit feedback about the problem,", "url": "https://x.com/JohnHowell37137/status/2121358656524738816"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2121366280707997696", "type": "photo", "url